    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Highlights&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;World’s largest e-drive LNG facility&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;Independent pretreatment and liquefaction facilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;Conversion of LNG import terminal&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;Enough daily LNG output to power and light San Antonio, Texas for an entire day&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-project-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Together, with our JV partner Chiyoda and Zachry Group, we achieved substantial completion of Trains 1, 2 and 3, bringing the project to full commercial operation. The project scope included three pre-treatment trains, a liquefaction facility with three trains, a second loading berth and a 165,000 m3 full containment LNG storage tank. The Freeport LNG facility incorporates the largest electric motor-driven refrigeration compressors in the world and will significantly improve North America's energy export capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-solutions-category field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;Liquefaction&lt;/div&gt;
      
